yer is hunted and chased by a relentless monster. Dark, claustrophobic environments, corpses on beds, bones and carcasses, and a general air of dread.\r\n\r\nUnethical human experimentation, including soul-binding, experimentation on living creatures, and pursuit of immortality through morally questionable means.\r\n\r\nThe story deals with death and bodily transformation and flowers growing out of corpses and environmental rot.\r\n\r\nOne of the mother’s letters refers to the father hitting her for the first time.\r\n\r\nNeglect of a sick child by the parents, a terminal disease, and an ambiguous ending that leaves the player wondering if they were helpful or harmful."}, "ratings": {"dejus": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "14", "required_age": "14", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Violência\nLinguagem imprópria\nAtos criminosos"}, "steam_germany": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "16", "required_age": "16", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Drastische Gewalt\nSchimpfwörte"}, "igrs": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "18", "required_age": "18", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Kekerasan\nHoror\nPenggunaan bahasa"}}}}}